
# `include/` — Project-Wide Headers

This directory contains global C/C++ headers shared across `src/`, `boards/`, and `lib/`. Because `-I include` is part of the root `build_flags` in `platformio.ini`, any header placed here is visible to all translation units in the firmware.

## Header Reference

| Header | Purpose | When to Include |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `globals.h` | Declares global singletons (`bruceConfig`, `bruceConfigPins`, `tft`, `serialCli`, `sdcardSPI`, `AUX_SPI`, `rtc`), navigation flags (`NextPress`, `PrevPress`, `SelPress`, `EscPress`, `AnyKeyPress`), and UI types (`Option`, `keyStroke`, `BruceTouchPoint`). | Include `<globals.h>` in core services and feature modules that interact with configuration, display, input state, or `loopOptions()`. Avoid including it in low-level standalone drivers or `src/hal/device.h`. |
| `interface.h` | Declares the board lifecycle hooks (`_setup_gpio()`, `_post_setup_gpio()`, `_pre_storage_gpio()`), power hooks (`getBattery()`, `isCharging()`, `powerOff()`, `goToDeepSleep()`, `checkReboot()`), backlight hook (`_setBrightness()`), and `InputHandler()`. | Include `<interface.h>` in `boards/<board>/interface.cpp` when implementing board-specific hardware initialization and input polling, or in core files invoking board hooks. |
| `MenuItemInterface.h` | Defines `MenuItemInterface`, the abstract base class for top-level menu entries (`optionsMenu()`, `drawIcon()`, theme icon rendering, and carousel/grid scaling). | Include `<MenuItemInterface.h>` when creating a new top-level menu class under `src/core/menu_items/`. |
| `precompiler_flags.h` | Normalizes compile-time `-D` flags from `boards/<board>/<board>.ini`, sets PSRAM-aware FreeRTOS stack sizes, maps button count macros, and provides safe fallback defaults (`-1` for unused pins, default font scales, `GPIO_PIN_LIST`). | Automatically included by `globals.h` and `DisplayDrivers_User_Setup.h`. Include `<precompiler_flags.h>` directly when checking hardware capability macros without pulling in all of `globals.h`. |
| `DisplayDrivers_User_Setup.h` | Configuration bridge included automatically by `lib/DisplayDrivers` before compiling display backends. Forwards `precompiler_flags.h` and maps `ROTATION` to `TFT_ROTATION`. | Do not include directly in feature code; consumed internally by `lib/DisplayDrivers`. |
| `SerialDevice.h` | Defines the abstract `SerialDevice` interface used by the Serial CLI and logging layer to write/read transparently over hardware `UART` or native `USBSerial`. | Include `"SerialDevice.h"` when implementing a new serial transport or writing code that accepts a generic `SerialDevice *`. |
| `tftLogger.h` | Declares `tft_logger`, a subclass of `tft_display` (`DisplayDrivers`) that intercepts drawing primitives and serializes binary screen diffs for the WebUI and Serial screen navigator. | Automatically included via `globals.h` (`extern tft_logger tft`). Include `<tftLogger.h>` only when working directly on display logging internals. |
| `current_year.h` | Defines `#define CURRENT_YEAR <YYYY>`. Auto-generated before every build by `pre_build_current_year.py`. | Include `"current_year.h"` when a fallback compile-time year is needed (e.g., RTC initialization in `src/main.cpp`). **Do not edit manually.** |
| `webFiles.h` | Contains gzipped `PROGMEM` byte arrays (`index_html`, etc.) for the embedded WebUI. Auto-generated before every build by `patch.py` from `embedded_resources/web_interface/`. | Included only by `src/core/wifi/webInterface.cpp`. **Do not edit manually** — modify files in `embedded_resources/web_interface/` instead. |

